source: crates/surfaces/cli/src/main.rs
expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
Add, remove or prune linked worktrees

Usage: specforge git worktree [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  add     Add a linked worktree at a directory (absent or empty) on a branch: its name when no --branch, made when missing
  remove  Remove a linked worktree and its directory: one with changes or untracked files only with --force
  prune   Drop the records of linked worktrees whose directories are gone
  lock    Lock a linked worktree so no prune or removal drops it
  unlock  Unlock a locked worktree
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --in <DIR>
          Run as if typed in this directory, as `git -C` runs: its project, the repository it is in, and every typed path read from it

  -h, --help
          Print help
